<title>PHILIPPINES: HI says Jan-March net at 35.3 mln pesos.</title>
<headline>HI says Jan-March net at 35.3 mln pesos.</headline>
<dateline>MANILA 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Philippine holding firm House of Investments Inc (HI) said on Friday its unaudited net income for the first quarter of the year reached 35.3 million pesos.</p>
<p>The company said revenues were 54.7 million pesos.</p>
<p>HI did not give comparative figures.</p>
</text>
